    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_t_s_a_client_wrapper" kindref="compound">TSAClientWrapper</ref> — production implementation of <ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_i_t_s_a_client" kindref="compound">ITSAClient</ref>.</para>
<para>Wraps the existing <ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_timestamp_authority" kindref="compound">TimestampAuthority</ref> backend, translates between the high-level TSARequest/TSAResponse types and the low-level <ref refid="structthemis_1_1security_1_1_timestamp_token" kindref="compound">TimestampToken</ref>, and fires the registered <ref refid="structthemis_1_1security_1_1_t_s_a_event_hooks" kindref="compound">TSAEventHooks</ref> callbacks. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
